<h1>Corporate</h1>
<p class="story-lead">Desk bookings, visitors, and workplace requests lived in separate tools. Reception and the workplace team were looking at two different days.</p>
<p>A visitor arrived for a desk that was already taken, because the booking lived in one app and the day list in another. The request to fix the desk was in a third thread.</p>
<p>They put desk bookings, visitors, and workplace requests on the same site record. Reception now sees the same day the workplace team planned.</p>
</article>
